    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "org-ms-6c47810265724481cecd23cb7b76ddd48f69504e68c20424214827d8b02752f0",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "69ece8245a2a6febf9a447ce660187f6316e7896605d1eb731a2b56c5d1aead2",
      "resource_identity": "6c4121d23172d83d344ac2a8ef917bcd454466ec3e7be39721bef621450f3053",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It keeps us up at night because we know she isn't sleeping.  Worse part is there is nothing we can do to help her.",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hi! It seems someone in the family is having sleeping issues. Correct me if I am wrong",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "My daughter is really sick and its causing her to have trouble sleeping.  Not sure what to do.",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Sorry to here about it. It must be hard for you to see her in trouble. ",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "May I ask What happen to her. ",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It is.  She's miserable, and it's causing us to not sleep as well.",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It's nothing serious, common cold, but she has asthma so whenever she gets sick, it causes labored breathing.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can feel how stressed you are right now but she will recover fast. ",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I know she will, I always lack sleep whenever she's not feeling well.  I wish I could be sick for her.",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "When my kid have cold, I nebulize her and later it make her sleep well",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "We do the same for her, and it helps for a couple hours but then she's up again.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Some people says giving green tea helps in cold.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Really, I'll have to try that. Thank you!",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Taking steamed shower helps in cold as well. You can try that too. I will pray for her speedy recovery.",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you so much.  You have been very helpful.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I feel much better after talking with you.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I hope you have a good rest of the day.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Mt best wishes are there with you. Be positive she will sleep well and recover soon.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1013",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I will. And I pray that she will.",
          "turn_index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "org-ms-21e3078bf5b4058c2200b87777953bc23c157d797f9c8114e8cedb15923733a0",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "f00b7d5a0bd2da99ce3f43b3ac0eb72062dd49b78117ef6b9944383c89d0a48f",
      "resource_identity": "97a3c2190240782b669853ae4ae6a3a9c830ec258edd8e70161882ba65c4e074",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Do you need help?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What is the real issue?",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I don't even know, because I am not happy",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Anxiety about losing my job",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I have been sad at times, but I listen to pleasant music.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "When have you started feeling sad?",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I had fear of losing my job at times.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I suggest doing stress relieving tasks",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I can't think of that of now, because last three month a go pay cut and nest month payoff ",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Can you repeat that? You had a pay cut in the last three months?",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah and the company is planning layoff for some of the staffs",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "How do you know that layoffs are coming?",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Why not try to work for Uber or Lyft to supplement your income?",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "They sent circular to all staffs",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What did it state? I am sorry to hear the news.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you looked at updating your resume and looking on job boards?",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "No I think I will just do that now may be it will help",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That is a great comment. Being pro-active and looking for similar jobs can help.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah thanks",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It' good to take initiative and start looking for other sources of income.",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I believe it work if I try.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I usually search job boards.  It is what I have dine in the past.",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It is important to believe in yourself.",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I am thinking about uber",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can also suggest Lyft...",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What other feelings and thoughts can I discern for you?",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I can't think of any now thanks for being there for me",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Bye for now",
          "turn_index": 27
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I think that I can be here to answer.  ",
          "turn_index": 28
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "org-ms-bf0fe65b53c42b2f35078250135af4c7edf3487d32a37980e1dc32707a58ad8e",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "97031304fd4cc45837bdc446080eb5e7f345861bd271706ad57bbbea6a24880a",
      "resource_identity": "e626482921bcee1dd168480549f5c406e6c60008cd054599c5b877a943b90ef9",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hello. How are you feeling today?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Hi, I'm feeling really anxious today.",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What has made you feel anxious?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yesterday my company laid off 10% of the workforce and another 10% got furloughed.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'm afraid I might be in the next round.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I am very sorry to hear that. I am currently in a situation where furloughs are greatly affecting my family as well.",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Oh no that's terrible.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "The problem is, I am right now the only breadwinner in the family. My wife was laid off three months ago",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Are you given specifics on time of furlough?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "No, it's basically until things get better.",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I know that's very difficult. And no doubt why you're here working for crumbs.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's why I'm here as well.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah, trying to make ends meet wherever I can",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I've been also trying to do uber as well but everyone is doing it also",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I know it's a difficult time. Yes Uber is definitely overrun right now. Have you taken any time out to address your anxiety so it doesn't become more serious? ",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I don't know what I can do. I've been trying to keep busy. And I can't afford a therapist or anything like that.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Yes, that's definitely an expense you can't afford right now. But are you familiar with the concept of controlled breathing to help reduce or relieve anxiety?",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Like meditation?",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "What am I supposed to do? Just breathe in and out a lot?",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Not exactly. Controlled breathing is more of getting yourself into a quiet room. Closing your eyes, and purposely and intently focusing on your breathing. Slowly breathe in for a count of 5, then slowly exhale for a count of 5. Repeat this process for approximately 10 minute. It will help your stress levels and help regulate your heart rate!",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Oh I didn't know that. No, I haven't tried that. Does it really work?",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I've been using it myself over the past 3 months and it most definitely helps! But it's absolutely imperative to clear your mind and have complete quiet.",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "ok I can try it I guess",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "thanks for that tip",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "No problem. I hope this gives you some relief! Stay strong!",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yeah, thanks. same to you",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "My final piece of advice would be to set aside time that is specified where nothing negative is discussed. No politics, no bills, nothing anxiety producing for you. It's probably best if this time is within an hour of your bedtime becuase anxiety is not conducive to a good night's sleep.",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That's helpful. Thanks.",
          "turn_index": 27
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "No problem. Take care. Wishing you well on your situation.",
          "turn_index": 28
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-16",
          "session_id": "esc652",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thanks. You too",
          "turn_index": 29
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "org-ms-c1626e8e1ee0ba33eaff78984559e8c867bb272dbd7fa55328086137b9bc0173",
