        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It really is! I am just taking in the fresh air in the backyard. ",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That is awesome.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Thanks! What is going on in your neck of the woods? ",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Sort of stuck inside trying to make a dime but it is alright.",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Yeah great minds think alike.. do you do anything else for work? ",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Looking for a good job right now.",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I wanted to talk about a personal issue I have been having, though.",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Okay, you know I'm here for you. Talk to me, what's happening? ",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "My father and I had a fight 2 years ago and haven't spoke since.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "The same happened to me, and then my father passed away. If there is anything I can say, is to swallow pride and cherish the moments you have on earth together. What was the fight over?",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah I am afraid that these things can happen. It was only over material things.",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That was my next question, what the fight was over. Do you think he would be open to mending things? ",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It is weird because I called him out for being manipulative so this is his defense. ",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Usually when people feel singled out, they only have a few mechanisms. Unfortunately, most people tend to run away instead of fixing things. It tends to be the easier option. ",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I would likely take advantage of an opportunity to be the bigger person.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "When you try to fix things, just remember that this is his method. I wouldn't hold back on what you have to say, but just word it so that he doesn't feel the need to flee. ",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That is probably decent advice.",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It is HIS responsibility as a parent to want to fix things, but you are also being the bigger person here. I applaud you and hope that he is receptive. ",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I hope so too, but the opportunity seems tenuous ",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "How did you guys leave it? ",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc968",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Threatening and disparagement haha",
