    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "org-ms-b9fc3b03b943bb83a3665092934c43a282a76a63438112fe4a3fc422a399ddff",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "a3b293063ed398700be5dce942cf040a212f7c3f03c9ebbf2be63ef368ba229d",
      "resource_identity": "124b7b9ac852ab61976f972f0a93bd0bd81a283a841afe950c0f8b001b303cb6",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hey Charles, I'm here for you. How are you holding up after everything with Emily?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Hi, it's been really challenging. Seeing Emily in the hospital is something no parent wants.",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I completely understand. It must be really hard to see her go through this. How is she doing now?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "She's stable now, thankfully. But every time she has an episode, it takes a toll on us, especially Margaret.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm relieved to hear Emily is stable. The stress must be immense for you both. What's been the most difficult part?",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I think it's the feeling of helplessness. We do everything we can, but it feels like we're just waiting for the next attack.",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds overwhelming, Charles. Feeling helpless is tough. Have you found anything that helps ease that feeling, even a little?",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Talking to someone helps a bit. And knowing we're following the doctor’s advice, but the uncertainty lingers.",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's good that you're reaching out and following medical guidance. It's okay to feel uncertain; anyone would in your shoes.",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thanks, I appreciate that. Margaret tries to be strong for Emily, but I can see it's wearing her down too.",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Margaret sounds like a wonderful mother, but it's important for both of you to care for yourselves too. How are you supporting each other?",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "We're trying to talk things out and give each other breaks. It's a work in progress.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That's a healthy approach. It's so important to lean on each other and take things one day at a time.",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah, some days are better than others. Getting back to a routine helps, but the worry is constant.",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That constant worry must be exhausting. Do you have any outlets or activities to help manage it?",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I try to go for a run in the mornings. It's not much, but it clears my head for a bit.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Exercise is great for stress relief. Even small moments of peace are valuable. You're doing your best, and that matters.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you. It's good to hear that. It's just hard not to feel guilty for needing time away.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Taking care of yourself isn't selfish; it's necessary. Being at your best helps you support Emily and Margaret even better.",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "You're right. I need to remember that. It's a delicate balance, but we're getting there.",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It sounds like you and Margaret are doing an incredible job under tough circumstances. Keep leaning on each other. You're not alone.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-15",
          "session_id": "p5_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 4,
